From: Dmitry R <rdmitry0911@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Connect native Wayland keyboard model to restricted seat layout API

Expose registered XKB layouts through the original SDDM keyboard model and
confirm layout selection against the per-seat controller. Authentication
and the system theme remain owned by SDDM. Bound the private layout popup
to a scrollable height so the full XKB registry remains usable.

Signed-off-by: Dmitry R <rdmitry0911@gmail.com>

